# scripts/secrets_gate.allow — files the secrets gate does not read, one per
# line: <path-regex><TAB><reason>.  A real secret is fixed, never allowed.
src/totpuri\.nv	the examples use the shared secrets of RFC 6238's test vectors, published
tests/totp_cover_tests\.nv	the tests use the shared secrets of RFC 6238's test vectors, published
